            </note>
            <note corresp="#d97-f5" n="5" xml:id="d97-f5-content">
                <p><ref target="#d98">Document 98</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d97-f6" n="6" xml:id="d97-f6-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d84-f3">footnote 3, Document 84</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d97-f7" n="7" xml:id="d97-f7-content">
                <p>In telegram 483, September 11, the Embassy and USOM questioned the wisdom of
                    delaying aid programs to Vietnam, suggested that U.S. policy make a clear
                    distinction between the Palace and the Vietnamese people, and suspend aid only
                    on projects which would affect Diem and his immediate circle of supporters.
                    (Department of State, Central Files, AID(US) S VIET)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
